0 34 661 [
[(An envelope follower measures the mean square power of an signal as it)]
[(changes over time. \050You can convert mean square power to RMS amplitude)]
[(or to decibels if you wish.\051 The term "mean square" means simply that)]
[(the signal should be squared, and then averaged. The averaging is done)]
[(using a low-pass filter such as [lop~].)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
